 <p>
+If a binding is present on an element that allows multiple types, the binding applies to all of the allowed types
+for which bindings are meaningful: <a href="#code">code</a>, <a href="#Coding">Coding</a>,
+<a href="#CodeableConcept">CodeableConcept</a>, <a href="#CodeableReference">CodeableReference</a>,
+<a href="#Quantity">Quantity</a>, <a href="#string">string</a>, and <a href="#uri">uri</a>. If a binding should
+only apply to a specific type in a choice element, <a href="profiling.html#slicing">slice</a> the element by type
+and apply the binding to the relevant slice.
+</p>
